# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# YOPO-only release curation (scope freeze 2026-10-13).
# Heavy raw evidence (ros2_flights bodies, quarantine, epoch checkpoints,
# training logs, full datasets) stays in the external archive described in
# report/06_migration; the files below are the curated set the standard
# documentation audit checks and the runtime entrypoints consume.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

